hero:
Use case: ads-marketing. Asset type: finished wide GitHub programmer profile hero, 2400 by 800 pixels, exactly 3:1 landscape.
A premium, deeply black, code-oriented personal portfolio masthead with the meticulous industrial design finish and restrained typography of a high-end Apple product launch. NO Apple logo or branding. Pure near-black #060709 canvas, cool monochrome, perfectly clean, no texture, no warm colors.
Left 52%: large crisp white modern sans-serif Chinese headline on two lines, exact text "一点好奇，" and "很多可能。" Above it a small monospaced label "十一 / LASTIME". Bottom left small monospaced label "AI / VISION / LEARNING".
Right 45%: a razor-thin black glass code-editor pane floating at a subtle 3/4 angle, nearly front-on for legibility, precise polished dark titanium edge and barely visible cool silver rim light. Fine horizontal hairline rules and sparse small editor dots. Pane contains elegantly typeset large highly legible monospaced TypeScript, exact five lines:
const lastime = {
  focus: ["AI", "Vision"],
  craft: "useful tools",
  status: "building"
};
The code is the visual subject. Syntax highlighting restrained ice-blue, mint and cool white; no rainbow, no neon bloom. Realistic black glass and satin-black metal, soft controlled studio reflections, remarkable precision and depth, quiet expensive material detail. Large negative space, perfect optical alignment. No additional slogan, no books, paper, cards, warm desk, bronze, loop sculptures, mascots, cartoon symbols, logos or watermarks. No browser page mockup surrounding the banner. Full bleed rectangular asset; exact text must be correct, headline readable at 800 px wide.

vocabulary:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: programming-style vocabulary app cover for a GitHub portfolio, 1600 by 960 pixels, exactly 5:3 landscape.
Refined black-on-black product concept with the precision, depth and lighting discipline of an Apple product launch. No Apple branding. Two razor-thin dark glass panes at slight offset, front pane mostly frontal, rear pane tilted slightly. Pure near-black seamless background, satin-black titanium edge, subtle cold white rim highlights. No warm colors, no paper or physical flashcards.
Front pane: a large white modern sans-serif word exactly "remember", below a precise tiny blue waveform made of about 12 thin vertical bars, and beneath it a small monospaced caption exactly "learn. review. repeat." Rear pane: subtle, clearly readable TypeScript snippet exactly:
const practice = {
  listen: true,
  recall: true,
  review: "daily"
};
Use only cool white, muted blue and mint syntax highlights. No other text, no progress numbers, no fake learners. The words and code should look extremely crisp and restrained, crafted as a conceptual cover about vocabulary practice and review, not a screenshot of the actual app. Floating panes, controlled realistic reflections, spare premium composition. Full bleed rectangle; no mascots, toys, paper, books, desks, bronze, rainbow glow, thick rounded poster card, or watermark.
